// res/usbmon.rc — Windows resources for usbmon.exe (windres, COFF output).
//
//   1 ICON "usbmon.ico"  — executable + tray icon (resource id 1).
//                         Generated by tools/make_icon.py; committed so
//                         builds never depend on Python being installed.
//
// Kept intentionally minimal: no VERSIONINFO block (the daemon reports
// its version via `usbmon --version` and the JSONL start event, and a
// .rc-side version would be a second copy to keep in sync).

1 ICON "usbmon.ico"
